"""Heuristic Hyperparameter Selection"""

1> Gamma 
Variation -  Higher Gamma => Better Denoising hence smoother pictures => not very good deblurring => No sharp features
          -  Lower Gamma => Better Deblurring hence sharper pictures => not very good denoising => Sharp image with good feature preservation,
             but has residual noise
Heuristic Selection -  Try values between (0.001 - 1)
